@title Definitions

@s Local declarations

The prose mentions @code{shared_name} in the same presentation section that
defines it.

--- definitions.rs
pub struct LocalType {
    field: usize,
}

pub fn shared_name(value: LocalType) -> LocalType {
    value
}
